{"4966140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TUPILAK", "steam_appid": 4966140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TUPILAK is a fast-paced action roguelite. Surf the waves of an abandoned city, pull off tricks in the air and slay the creatures that infest it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURF A SEA OF CONCRETE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city streets move like waves. Learn to read them, keep your speed, launch off the crests and dodge the creatures coming after you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO TRICKS TO STAY ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping isn't just a way to dodge. Your powers recharge while you're in the air, and the tricks you pull off charge them with different elemental forces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR BUILD EVERY RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay creatures to collect gold and buy upgrades that change the way you attack. Combine them your own way and reach the ultimate build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type of creature attacks differently, forcing you to rethink how you move: where to ride, when to jump, and when you can afford to go for a trick. Survive as long as you can and see how far you can get.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TUPILAK is a fast-paced action roguelite. Surf the waves of an abandoned city, pull off tricks in the air and slay the creatures that infest it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURF A SEA OF CONCRETE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city streets move like waves. Learn to read them, keep your speed, launch off the crests and dodge the creatures coming after you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO TRICKS TO STAY ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping isn't just a way to dodge. Your powers recharge while you're in the air, and the tricks you pull off charge them with different elemental forces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR BUILD EVERY RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay creatures to collect gold and buy upgrades that change the way you attack. Combine them your own way and reach the ultimate build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type of creature attacks differently, forcing you to rethink how you move: where to ride, when to jump, and when you can afford to go for a trick. Survive as long as you can and see how far you can get.</p>", "short_description": "Surf the concrete waves of an abandoned city. Slay hordes of creatures made of bone and hate. Pick and combine magic powers until you become something worse than them.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966140/eaa4e7f5c5c051d69e8e894b0b6007bfd18e13ac/header.jpg?t=1785330302", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966140/1014dc12619bf1aab554ff1274c76af515adbce0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785330302", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966140/1014dc12619bf1aab554ff1274c76af515adbce0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785330302", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 (2 GB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Deadline Cult"], "publishers": ["Deadline Cult"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories"